        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GVCCHM, Grande Victorian Plate with Chambord Crystal Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ornate Grande Victorian Plate design combined with a classical 24% Lead Crystal Chambord Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the glamorous finish choices. Reminiscent of the old world, the Grande Victorian Plate With Chambord Knob's elaborate yet graceful design will add sparkling opulence to any home. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-grande-victorian-series\"><b>Grande Victorian Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GVCCHM Grande Victorian Plate With Chambord Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Grande Victorian Plate is made out of solid forged brass and the Chambord Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grande Victorian Chambord Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Height: 8.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Chambord Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Chambord Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GVCCHM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262182\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GVCCHM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grande Victorian Plate With Chambord Knob, Grandeur GVCCHM",
                "description": "Grande Victorian Chambord Knob Grandeur GVCCHM - The ornate Grande Victorian Plate design combined with a classical 24% Lead Crystal Chambord Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the glamorous finish choices. Reminiscent of the old world, the Grande Victorian Plate With Chambord Knob's elaborate yet graceful design will add sparkling opulence to any home. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
